  "title": "Southwest Breakfast Burritos",
  "description": "This Mexican-inspired breakfast burrito recipe is loaded with sausage, eggs, and cheese, so you can enjoy a great meal even on your busiest morning.",
  "authors": [
    "Norm Walker"
  ],
